WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.375
Which cloud matters here in three ways.

2
00:00:02.375 --> 00:00:07.805
The endpoints: this estate's GCC tenant
uses commercial Azure, so its servers reach

3
00:00:07.805 --> 00:00:13.475
the commercial machine configuration hosts,
with a regional endpoint in each region.

4
00:00:13.475 --> 00:00:16.069
The way machines read the package matters:

5
00:00:16.069 --> 00:00:19.109
the build uses each machine's
own system identity,

6
00:00:19.109 --> 00:00:24.075
because Learn says a user-assigned identity
doesn't work for Arc-enabled servers.

7
00:00:24.075 --> 00:00:28.974
And cost: for Arc-enabled Windows servers
with the right licensing, it's included,

8
00:00:28.974 --> 00:00:32.240
though Learn lists a few
regions outside commercial

9
00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:35.040
US Azure where that
activation isn't offered.
